    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BPS301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">BPS301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Fundamentals of Business Process Management</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Marlon DumasMarcello La RosaJan MendlingHajo A. Reijers · Springer · ISBN <code>9783662565087</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/analysis-for-business-systems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/analysis-for-business-systems</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/six-sigma-principles?specialization=six-sigma-fundamentals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/six-sigma-principles?specialization=six-sigma-fundamentals</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/six-sigma-tools-define-measure?specialization=six-sigma-fundamentals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/six-sigma-tools-define-measure?specialization=six-sigma-fundamentals</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/six-sigma-analyze?specialization=six-sigma-fundamentals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/six-sigma-analyze?specialization=six-sigma-fundamentals</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p></div>"
